### 2026-10-10 — When and how to reopen step 1 (operator ruling)
- **Chose:** A (operator: "A"): reopen now; a TermLink worker drafts v0.5 from the 20 accepted change requests with
  traceability; Codex consistency check; operator sign-off of v0.5. Step-2 sign-off may run in parallel because
